 /*
- * AppleHapticsSupportCallan / AppleHapticsSupportUserClient.
+ * AppleHapticsSupport / AppleHapticsSupportCallan /
+ * AppleHapticsSupportUserClient.
  *
- * On a real device the HID event system opens the Callan user client for
- * UIKit/HID haptics (keyboard feedback, context menus, system controls).
- * The Redmi has no Taptic Engine, so Apple's Callan driver is absent and
- * those events currently die before reaching any user client.  Publish a
- * service with the same matching shape and a logging user client so we can
- * see the protocol; no real-device calibration or serial data is embedded.
+ * 参考机（iPhone X / iOS 16）上的真实类链是
+ *
+ *     IOService
+ *       -> AppleHapticsSupport          (0x170 bytes, 自 168 号槽起有 24 个虚函数)
+ *         -> AppleHapticsSupportCallan  (0x200 bytes)
+ *
+ * AppleHapticsSupport 负责 start/registerService、AHSCommandQueue、AOP 会话，
+ * Callan 只实现父类留出的槽位。UserClient 通过 externalMethod selector 0..9
+ * 与用户态交换 XML（Symbols / Values / AccessOptions / AOP 符号内存布局）。
+ *
+ * 这里按同样形状重建服务，并加入 P1 可区分诊断：
+ *   - start / registerService / provider 名称与类名 / 完整 OSMetaClass 链
+ *   - newUserClient 每次尝试、类型与结果
+ *   - callPlatformFunction 收到的 AHSFunction 名称与参数
+ *   - notifyHapticsSessionChange
+ *   - UserClient 打开时的 entitlement 结果
+ *
+ * 不产生任何伪造触感：所有事件仍来自真实内核/用户态路径。
  */
-class AppleHapticsSupportUserClient : public SweetHapticsUCBase {
-	OSDeclareDefaultStructors(AppleHapticsSupportUserClient);
-};
-OSDefineMetaClassAndStructors(AppleHapticsSupportUserClient, SweetHapticsUCBase);
 
